---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { links } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Churn Sheet"
  description="Why Churn Sheet exists: shop-floor friction turned into a production planner."
>
  <section class="prose">
    <p class="kicker mono">ABOUT</p>
    <h1>From the freezer to the plan.</h1>
    <p>
      Churn Sheet started as a tool for a gelato store that needed clearer answers mid-shift: what is
      low, what must be used today, what fits the remaining churn window, and which wash is required
      before the next group.
    </p>
    <p>
      This marketing site and the companion app are public PoCs under Virginia Perpetua’s GitHub,
      mirrored to GitLab. Design tokens come from
      <a href={links.tokensRepo}>virgiperpetua/tokens</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href={links.app}>Open the live app</a> or
      <a href={links.appRepo}>browse its source</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
